@ui @auth
Feature: Login and session management

    @smoke
    Scenario: As a user, I should see Google login and developer login options, when I navigate to the login page

    Scenario: As a guest, I should see my account information after being redirected to the home page, when I click Geliştirici girişi (mock)

    Scenario: As a user, I should return to the protected perfume detail page, when I complete login with a next URL

    Scenario: As a logged in user, I should see the guest user menu after signing out, when I click Çıkış yap

    Scenario: As a user, I should see login options without horizontal overflow, when I open the login page at 375 pixels
